===Bernot ''et al.'' (2023)===
In recent study, Bernot ''et al.'' placed [[Copepoda]] as a sister group to [[Branchiopoda]] in [[Allotriocarida]], which result in the recovery of clade Communostraca. Multicrustacea was not found. There are some major changes within class [[Malacostraca]].{{r|Bernot2023}}

